eir intensely  toxic behavior in contrast in the movie  the symbiote chooses eddie out of an  appreciation for who he is not how he  can album get what he wants so if the  core of a relationship is treating each  other well then the movie might show us  the best case scenario of eddie and the  symbiote's bond they ultimately decide  to stay together because they share a  mutual understanding even if the  symbiote is a bit harsh about it i have  decided to stay wow on my planet i am  kind of a loser like you they  demonstrate genuine empathy and care for  each other and their cooperation lets  each of them accomplish far more than  they could alone the film is bookended  by eddie's corner store being robbed the  first time eddie stands by helplessly  but the second time venom takes action  that's some  very ravenous teamwork and sure they  might bicker sometimes but what couple  doesn't it's basically when harry met  sally for the modern era so does this  explain why we just can't resist  shipping this unlikely pair well  yes and no their relationship might  closely mirror nozick's philosophical  take on love but there are complicated  truths to contend with not to put two  finer points on it but venom's  essentially a talking pile of gloop even  peak aramaic ryan couldn't make that  seem romantic still the core of venom is  universal two beings get to know each  other like no one else and in turn they  feel like they have to be together they  can tell us that it's a story about  revenge or justice all they want but  despite it being between a screwed up  has-been and some runny alien plato  we know love when we see it  but what do you guys think can two bros  find love in a weird symbiotic  relationship or are people just weird  and willing to romanticize anything so  long as it leads to good fanfic let us  know what you think in the comments  smash that subscribe button like you're  possessed by an intergalactic symbiote  and don't forget to ring that bell  thanks 